# systemd/ duplication tree (exact ~2883 LOC mirror of lib/modules/config) — killed per policies/security-remediation.md as high-severity vulnerability (Phase 1 of arch-machine-overhaul). FS removal may require manual sudo on some envs; gitignored to prevent reappearance. References purged from maintenance/ and docs. Do not recreate.
systemd/

# Root pollution killed in Phase 1 (arch-machine-overhaul): .kilo/ (plans + package-lock from prior agent experiments), .composer/ (wave artifacts), setups/ (legacy duplication variants with no active references). Added per security-remediation policy to prevent reintroduction. Evidence bundles 134739/134750/134802 document the kills.
.kilo/
.composer/
setups/

# groxy operator identity (never commit real X user ids)
config/groxy/allowlist.local.conf
config/groxy/*.local.conf

